  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pue7Uy5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>\n![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fCOMPATIBLE-FORGE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/COMPATIBLE-FORGE</a> &amp; FABRIC-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&amp;style=for-the-badge)<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REQUIRES-ARCHITECTURY-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>FindMe</strong> 允许你通过按下按键来搜索附近容器中的物品。只需将鼠标悬停在物品上（兼容 JEI）并按下 \"<strong>Y</strong>\" 键（默认设置），拥有该物品的容器周围就会生成云朵粒子效果。</p>\n<p>它还允许你通过在小键盘上按 <strong>0</strong> 或 <strong>1</strong> 从附近的容器中<strong>提取</strong>物品。0 键会给你 1 个物品，1 键会给你一组物品。</p>\n<p>搜索范围可以在<strong>配置文件</strong>中进行配置。</p>\n<p>此模组需要同时安装在<strong>客户端和服务端</strong>。</p>\n<p>此功能基于 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/extra-utilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Utilities 2</a> 中的搜索功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2n2onOS.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.worldvectorlogo.com%252flogos%252fdiscord.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/discord.svg</a>)&nbsp;[Discord](<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4tPfwjn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/4tPfwjn</a>)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.djmaclennan.com%252fwp-content%252fuploads%252f2017%252f06%252fpatreon_logo.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.djmaclennan.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/patreon_logo.png</a>)&nbsp;[Patreon](<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/buuz135\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/buuz135</a>) &nbsp; &nbsp; ![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn3.iconfinder.com%252fdata%252ficons%252fsocial-icons-5%252f606%252fTwitter.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cdn3.iconfinder.com/data/icons/social-icons-5/606/Twitter.png</a>) [Twitter](<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Buuz135mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/Buuz135mods</a>)</p>",
